        "text": "=Summarize one article for {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.symbol }} in 3 compact bullets.\nTitle: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.title }}\nPublished: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.published }}\nCategory: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.category }}\nSynopsis: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.synopsis }}\nArtifact (truncated): {{ $('News Retrieval - S3') }}",
